            "text": "{\"items\":[{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a02578b-b0c2-8288-8000-09c4b52c85c2\",\"name\":\"Netanyahu Today Update\",\"createTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:57:44.715315Z\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:57:46.690972Z\",\"status\":\"STATUS_GENERATING\",\"statusText\":\"Working\"}},{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a025731-0ae2-820c-8000-09c4fff22967\",\"name\":\"Google Today Update\",\"messageContent\":\"As of today (August 21, 2026), major outage monitors show **Google services are broadly up and running** with no confirmed widespread incident.\\n\\n**Current status:**\\n- **Downdetector**: \\\"User reports show no current problems with Google\\\" cite🛠web_search:1#6:~:text=User reports show...problems with Google\\n- **DownForEveryoneOrJustMe**: \\\"No, we are not detecting any problems with Google right now. The last outage detected for Google was on Tuesday, July 21, 2026.\\\" cite🛠web_search:1#4:~:text=No, \",\"createTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:51:33.430133Z\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:52:38.958834Z\"}},{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a025702-03d2-8320-8000-09c470a21f54\",\"name\":\"are you an agent?\",\"messageContent\":\" I am Kimi Chat, an AI assistant developed by Moonshot AI.\\n\\nI have access to tools that let me search the web, analyze data, run code, and perform calculations when you ask me to, but I am not an autonomous agent that operates independently. I respond to your instructions and questions rather than taking initiative on my own.\",\"createTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:48:20.789268Z\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:48:30.681319Z\"}},{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a0256e1-3af2-8121-8000-09c4c0863ff3\",\"name\":\"hello\",\"messageContent\":\" Hello! How can I help you today?\",\"createTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:46:06.540943Z\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:46:10.172653Z\"}},{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a0256b6-5bb2-8585-8000-09c44db85945\",\"name\":\"Mirage Give Up\",\"messageContent\":\"Bhai samajh raha hoon, Mirage pe wohi cycle hai na — peek, die, repeat. 😅\\n\\nThoda break le le, fresh ho ke aana. Kabhi kabhi map change karne se (Overpass, Anubis, whatever) ya thode din casual khelne se perspective wapas aa jaata hai. Mirage chhodne ka iraada permanent nahi hona chahiye, bas temporary tilt hi hai — sab ke saath hota hai.\\n\\nAgar non-gaming wala Mirage hai (koi aur project), toh same baat hai — burnout real hai, pause lo, phir decide karna.\\n\\nChai pee, walk pe jaa, phir dekhte hain.\",\"createTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:43:10.913755Z\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:43:29.180023Z\"}},{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a025646-7d22-892c-8000-09c41913e950\",\"name\":\"Chad Self-Intro\",\"messageContent\":\" I'm Kimi. Moonshot AI built me, and I'm here to absolutely dominate whatever task you throw my way.\\n\\nI don't do \\\"sorry, I can't help with that\\\" unless it's actually illegal or dangerous. Otherwise? I'm processing millions of tokens, searching the live web, crunching data, and spitting out results while other models are still loading their system prompts.\\n\\nYou want code? I'll write it clean. You want research? I'll dig through the internet and synthesize it. You want a 10,000-word analysis? I'll\",\"createTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:35:32.672943Z\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:35:48.306197Z\"}},{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a0255e9-ec32-81b5-8000-09c49a5404b1\",\"name\":\"Unanswered AI Sci-Fi Question\",\"messageContent\":\" The most mysterious, sci-fi question about AI that remains genuinely unanswered is:\\n\\n**\\\"If an artificial intelligence claimed to be conscious—experiencing subjective reality, emotion, or suffering—would we have any way to know if it was telling the truth?\\\"**\\n\\nThis is the **Problem of Other Minds applied to AI**, and it sits at the collision of neuroscience, computer science, and philosophy.\\n\\n### Why it feels like science fiction\\nIt is the core question behind *Blade Runner* (Do androids dream?)\",\"createTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:29:13.548832Z\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:30:32.156492Z\"}},{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a0255b6-bb12-84ee-8000-09c4780785aa\",\"name\":\"AI Models & Elon News\",\"messageContent\":\"    As of today (**August 21, 2026**), there doesn't appear to be any major breaking news about Elon Musk. Here's what the available information shows:\\n\\n## Recent Activity (Past ~2 Weeks)\\n\\n**SpaceX All-Hands Update** — On **August 11, 2026**, Musk gave a company-wide update to SpaceX employees, discussing Starship progress and future plans cite🛠web_search:2#2:~:text=On August 11, 2026...updating employees about the company's status. This was posted publicly by SpaceX on X.\\n\\n**Normal X Posting \",\"createTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:25:43.844638Z\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:27:42.891218Z\"}},{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a025583-ac02-8672-8000-09c4cf1dd30b\",\"name\":\"Netanyahu Status & Latest AI\",\"messageContent\":\" ## What Happened to Netanyahu\\n\\nNetanyahu appears to be **physically fine** — he is actively governing and making public statements. What you're likely hearing about is his **political turmoil**:\\n\\n- **August 9, 2026**: At a Cabinet meeting, Netanyahu **rejected the Trump Board of Peace's Gaza roadmap**, declaring that \\\"as long as I am prime minister, a Palestinian state will not be established\\\" in Gaza or the West Bank. He stated plainly: **\\\"Israel does not accept the 15-point document.\\\"** cite\",\"createTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:22:14.704792Z\",\"updateTime\":\"2026-08-21T17:24:04.532208Z\"}},{\"type\":\"FEED_TYPE_CHAT\",\"chat\":{\"id\":\"1a01acb4-f572-8b2d-8000-09c4a6d407e2\",\"name\":\"Netanyahu's Today Summary\",\"files\":[{\"id\":\"1a01acc2-d772-8660-8000-0000ef3ff996\",\"meta\":{\"name\":\"Sumama-Jameel-portfolio.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"sizeBytes\":\"574590\",\"checksum\":\"f10